  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Expert - DG Clima - International affairs and Climate Financed, Bryssel - National Expert - DG Clima - International affairs &amp; Climate Finance, Bryssel TG</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell Expert - DG Clima - International affairs and Climate Finance, Bryssel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xe4;r en sekundering som skall arbeta f&#xf6;r EU inom verksamhetsomr&#xe5;det klimat. Sekunderingen best&#xe5;r i att utveckla EU:s bilaterala relationer med tredjel&#xe4;nder f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja ambiti&#xf6;sa klimat- och h&#xe5;llbara energipolicys, s&#xe4;rskilt genom att uppmuntra partnerl&#xe4;nder att &#xf6;verg&#xe5; till en klimatneutral och motst&#xe5;ndskraftig ekonomi samt att anpassa nationella policyer till nationellt best&#xe4;mda bidrag.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assignment is a secondment that will work for the EU within the area of climate. The secondment involves developing the EU&apos;s bilateral relations with third countries to promote ambitious climate and sustainable energy policies, especially by encouraging partner countries to transition to a climate-neutral and resilient economy and to align national policies with nationally determined contributions.</narrative>
  </description>
